      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "(C) 2011 Lippincott Williams & Wilkins, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "We compared the effects of ibandronate and pamindronate in patients with bone metastases from breast or lung cancer and we found that ibandronate is superior to pamindronate in alleviating pain, improving mobility and quality of life, and reducing bone resorption indices in patients with bone metastases from breast or lung cancer."
